  "description": "A .NET library for publishing and consuming RabbitMQ messages. Supports typed JSON messaging, manual acknowledgement, request/reply via Direct Reply-to, configurable reply timeout, automatic connection recovery, multiple broker connections, well-typed exceptions, health checks, and built-in OpenTelemetry tracing, metrics and structured logs following messaging semantic conventions. Ships a Roslyn analyzer that flags polymorphic message types passed or read as a derived type at compile time.",
